---
import { Section } from "../ui";
---

<Section id="contact">
  <article class="text-center mb-12">
    <p class="font-serif text-xs tracking-[0.3em] text-muted uppercase mb-5">
      Olivos | Zona Norte | Consultas legales
    </p>
    <h2 class="font-serif font-bold leading-none tracking-tighter select-none" style="font-size:clamp(3.5rem,12vw,8rem)">
      <span class="text-ink">TRIBLAN</span>
      <span style="color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:1px rgba(201, 165, 99, 0.95)">Estudio Jurídico</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-5 text-muted max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed text-sm">
      Asesoramiento jurídico especializado en derecho laboral, accidentes de tránsito y defensa del consumidor con un enfoque cercano y eficaz.
    </p>
  </article>

  <article class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-line2 bg-surface2/80 p-8">
      <p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-muted mb-3">Email</p>
      <a href="mailto:estudiotriblan@gmail.com" class="text-sm font-medium text-ink hover:text-ink/80 transition">estudiotriblan@gmail.com</a>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-line2 bg-surface2/80 p-8">
      <p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-muted mb-3">WhatsApp</p>
      <a href="https://wa.me/541169154261" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink hover:text-ink/80 transition mb-2">+54 11 6915 4261</a>
      <a href="https://wa.me/541137855936" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink hover:text-ink/80 transition">+54 11 3785 5936</a>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-line2 bg-surface2/80 p-8">
      <p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-muted mb-3">Atención</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed">Estamos disponibles para evaluar tu caso y ofrecer una estrategia legal clara y comprometida.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Section>